<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's Howard to hold news conference.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's Howard to hold news conference.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard will hold a news conference at 9.45 a.m. (2245 GMT), his office said on Monday.</p>
<p>A spokesman said Howard will make an announcement regarding the Russian space probe which is expected to hit east-central Australia.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
